; The importing half of the copy_files pair. This directory holds one test
; stanza and no source of its own: the module it compiles is drawn from
; ../source and stays where it was named, as the js/wasm arms of a package
; that runs one spec under two backends do. The directory a stanza is declared
; in is not the directory its sources sit in, and reading the second for the
; first counts this stanza against ../source.

(copy_files#
 (files ../source/test.ml))

(test
 (name test)
 (libraries alcotest))
